# Loxodon Battle Priest: "At the beginning of combat on your turn, put a +1/+1 counter on another target creature you
# control." Bot1 casts Memnite and the 3/5 Elephant Cleric on turn 1 (five Moxen pay {4}{W}). At the beginning of combat
# Memnite, the only "another" creature, gets a +1/+1 counter: 2/2, while the Priest stays 3/5 (it can't target itself).
# The counter stays: on turn 3 the trigger puts a second one on Memnite, 3/3, a counter being no pump that wears off.
# Bot2's turn gets no trigger: the ability is for Bot1's own combat only.

